{"src":"ro","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":217100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"ro","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":11340.280535999998,"text":"În 1990 a fost adăugat pe lista de situri patrimoniu mondial în pericol, din cauza pericolului reprezentat de nisipul deșertic."},{"kind":"text","t":12069.911559999999,"text":"In 1990 it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger, due to the danger posed by desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":12119.625392999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12121.152583,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12123.271986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12124.453508999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":12126.042421,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":12127.690254,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":12128.062381,"samples":15192,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":60},{"kind":"input","t":21331.218238,"text":"Dacă ai urmărit filmul Moara Națională, ai putea crede că o harta comorii a fost scrisă pe spatele declarației de independență."},{"kind":"text","t":22041.358403000002,"text":"If you watched the movie The National Mill, you might think that a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":22088.029775000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22089.601566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":22091.233628,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":22092.901002000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22094.516364000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":22096.111796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":22096.427092,"samples":11592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":32632.054925000004,"text":"Copiii sunt plasați în îngrijire familială pentru numeroase motive, care variază de la neglijență la abuz, mergând chiar până la extorcare."},{"kind":"text","t":33234.622803,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for many reasons, ranging from neglect to abuse, even extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":33280.466128,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33281.821005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33283.388256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33284.994388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33286.731613,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33287.452597,"samples":20360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":44350.774048,"text":"Valea Corchamo, locul cel mai cautat pentru alpinism din Chile, cunoscuta ca El Smaita la Merge de Sud, cu o varietate de pereti si piscuri inalte de granit."},{"kind":"text","t":45271.001517000004,"text":"The Corchamo Valley, the most sought-after climbing destination in Chile, known as El Smaita in the southwest, featuring a variety of cliffs and high granite peaks."},{"kind":"audio","t":45323.439283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45325.046955,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45326.720769,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45328.285840000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45329.940653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45331.572306,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45333.227139,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45334.916533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45335.29882,"samples":13256,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":52264.346732,"text":"Erau acceptate ideile lui Aristotel despre toate aspectele legate de știință, inclusiv psihologie."},{"kind":"text","t":52711.234242,"text":"Aristotle's ideas about all aspects of science, including psychology, were accepted."},{"kind":"audio","t":52757.632449000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52758.932064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52760.548887000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52762.19754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":52763.358433,"samples":27328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":62434.382468,"text":"Dacă ești obișnuit să conduci pe drumuri de țară, nu-ți pierde controlul. Pantele abrupte, benzile înguste și curbele periculoase predomină."},{"kind":"text","t":62932.588623,"text":"If you’re used to driving on country roads, don’t lose control. Steep slopes, narrow lanes, and dangerous bends predominate."},{"kind":"audio","t":62974.198883000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62975.836826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":62977.477379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":62977.833656,"samples":12096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":63012.647741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":63014.249563,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":63015.816014,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":63016.13442,"samples":12696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75403.291273,"text":"Prezența unei adevărate echipe invizibile, Larsson și la Fasto, 1989, pagina 109, reprezintă de asemenea o componentă unică a unei echipei virtuale."},{"kind":"text","t":76345.048511,"text":"The presence of a real invisible team, Larsson and Fasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":76397.313004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76398.659651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76400.522938,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":76402.130051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76403.70196199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76405.378545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":76406.908996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":76408.567579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76409.30766399999,"samples":18656,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":83293.245245,"text":"După ce a avut loc accidentul, Gibson a fost transportat la un spital, dar a decedea la scurt timp după aceea."},{"kind":"text","t":83798.577182,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was taken to a hospital, but died shortly afterwards."},{"kind":"audio","t":83843.411637,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83844.670692,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83846.311905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83848.047419,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83849.232043,"samples":29728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":91490.671208,"text":"Multe produse de panificație rălțești conțin și migdale, alune de păture și alte nuci."},{"kind":"text","t":91917.94600699999,"text":"Many bakery products also contain almonds, hazelnuts, and other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":91961.23078099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91962.956425,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91964.92644499999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91966.249831,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":91966.37367399999,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":96563.65159099999,"text":"Dese ori, prăjiturile populare merg foarte bine cu o ceașcă de cafea tare."},{"kind":"text","t":96968.37474999999,"text":"Often, popular cakes go very well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":97011.069792,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97012.42278899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":97014.160144,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":97014.65393399999,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":105683.514315,"text":"Evident, cine cunoaște o limbă romanică va învăța cu mai multă ușurință portugheza."},{"kind":"text","t":106105.382785,"text":"Obviously, anyone who knows a Romance language will learn Portuguese more easily."},{"kind":"audio","t":106149.19089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":106150.663829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106152.299542,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":106153.86424299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":106154.292042,"samples":13528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":117494.929164,"text":"Spectacolul de sunete și lumini organizat la piramidă este unul dintre cele mai interesante lucruri pentru copii din întreaga zona."},{"kind":"text","t":118113.541313,"text":"The sound and light show organized at the pyramid is one of the most interesting things for children in the whole area."},{"kind":"audio","t":118164.02741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118165.35595699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118166.907238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118168.56821099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118170.195543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118171.198303,"samples":23960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"input","t":126541.166598,"text":"Fluxul traficului studiază mișcarea șoferilor și vehiclului individual între două puncte și felul în care aceștia interacționează între ei."},{"kind":"text","t":127103.076124,"text":"Traffic flow studies the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and how they interact with each other."},{"kind":"audio","t":127151.13875299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127152.54848099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127154.19357399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127155.843467,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127157.417739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127159.15778299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":127159.275136,"samples":7392,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":134366.33620800002,"text":"Mitchell Gurley din Australia terminat al 11-a la Catorilea Bărbații în picioare la Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":134932.576231,"text":"Australia’s Mitchell Gurley finished 11th in the Fourteenth Men’s Standing Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":134976.58793900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134978.042859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134979.63921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":134981.195691,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":134981.353145,"samples":9328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":141267.220219,"text":"Adversarul ceh, older și șelnic, a terminat așa, iar cea la categoria bărbații așezată, asupra cei cei ce au fost încălzite."},{"kind":"text","t":142038.04000500002,"text":"The Czech opponent, older and gray, finished like that, and the one in the men’s category sitting, among those who were heated."},{"kind":"audio","t":142086.012163,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":142087.40504100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":142089.05688400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142090.751867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142092.4007,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142094.084154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":950},{"kind":"audio","t":142094.205796,"samples":3792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":152989.940528,"text":"Institutul Haitian pentru Dreptate și Democrație a citat studii independente care sugerează că Batalionul ONU nepales de menținerea păcii ar fi introdus"},{"kind":"text","t":153607.24652000002,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion introduced"},{"kind":"audio","t":153666.189587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153667.568394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":153669.122975,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153670.75877800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":153672.459152,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":153674.114275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":153675.73914700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153676.698986,"samples":23224,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":155794.353997,"text":"neintenționat voala în Haiti."},{"kind":"text","t":156070.590991,"text":"unintentionally veiled in Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":156109.338655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156110.863715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":156110.980718,"samples":4064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":163383.98623500002,"text":"La scurt timp după începerea ostilităților, Marea Britanie a inițiat o blocadă navală"},{"kind":"text","t":163812.288535,"text":"Shortly after the start of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade"},{"kind":"audio","t":163854.6227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163856.240842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":163858.225312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163859.604989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":163859.712911,"samples":5728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":174722.77199500002,"text":"De asemenea, ataca orice intra în apă, nici măcar un dinozaur uriaș precum T-Rex nu i-ar fi putut face față."},{"kind":"text","t":175389.08023400002,"text":"It also attacks anything that enters the water; not even a huge dinosaur like T-Rex could have dealt with it."},{"kind":"audio","t":175433.10785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":175434.624,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175435.561809,"samples":23864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":390},{"kind":"audio","t":175471.610273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175473.29861700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175474.969921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":175475.098084,"samples":8496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":185429.587049,"text":"Folosirea registrărilor video a dus la descoperiri importante în interpretarea microexpresiilor a mișcărilor faciale care durează câteva milisecunde."},{"kind":"text","t":186163.159476,"text":"The use of video recordings has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions of facial movements that last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":186223.427182,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186224.79356000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186226.41011300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186227.996805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186229.94252500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186231.324533,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186232.875864,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186234.63498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":186234.734742,"samples":4856,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":194092.265905,"text":"Anunțul a fost făcut după ce Trump a purtat o conversație telefonică cu președintele turc."},{"kind":"text","t":194512.431855,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a telephone conversation with the Turkish president."},{"kind":"audio","t":194558.333909,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194560.053064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194562.08058500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194563.42666300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":194564.27832,"samples":21328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":196780.557739,"text":"Recep taiperdugan"},{"kind":"text","t":196969.144386,"text":"Recep Taiperdugan"},{"kind":"audio","t":196994.55487300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":196994.86583,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":200},{"kind":"input","t":204594.611165,"text":"Acestea sunt uneori plaje de familie aglomerate cu o paletă largă de magazine dispuse de-a lungul malului."},{"kind":"text","t":205089.884654,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a wide range of shops arranged along the shore."},{"kind":"audio","t":205136.002922,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":205137.490612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":205139.071375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":205140.738478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":205142.173748,"samples":30928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":207392.605221,"text":"Se poate nota în siguranță."},{"kind":"text","t":207595.355967,"text":"It can be safely noted."},{"kind":"audio","t":207633.065454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":207633.628306,"samples":21232,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":215912.58890200002,"text":"Cel mai multe dintre insule mai mici sunt națiuni independente sau asociate cu Franța și sunt renumite ca stațiuni de plajă de lux."},{"kind":"text","t":216508.516229,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and are renowned as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":216557.973995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216559.36257300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216560.926335,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216562.63402,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":216564.371155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216565.999008,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":216566.910687,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"close","t":227105.716198,"code":1005}]}